  "description": "Give your AI assistant eyes into your logs. CSharpEssentials.LoggerHelper.MCP exposes a zero-dependency Model Context Protocol (MCP) server over HTTP — letting Claude, Cursor, Copilot, and any MCP-compatible client inspect sink health, recent errors, routing config, and live diagnostics with natural language. The first .NET logging library with native AI tooling built in. New in 5.1.0: zero-allocation JSON-RPC 2.0 handler; call POST /mcp from any MCP client to query your running app.",
